{"path":"ranges/transform_view/iterator/operator*","title":"std::ranges::transform_view<V,F>::iterator<Const>::operator*","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::transform_view&lt;V,F&gt;::<i>iterator</i>&lt;Const&gt;::</span>operator*","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/transform_view/iterator/operator*","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the transformed element.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the transformed element.\n</p><p>Effectively returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw1065\">std::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>parent_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>fun_, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>current_<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>*parent_-&gt;fun_</code> is the transformation function stored in the parent <code>transform_view</code>, and <code>current_</code> is the underlying iterator into <code>V</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The transformed element.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is not provided.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if the pointer to parent <code>transform_view</code> is null (e.g. if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is default constructed).\n</p><p>If <code>*current_</code> is a prvalue, its lifetime ends before this function returns. If the transformation function returns a reference or pointer to it, the result would dangle.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/transform_view","title":"std::ranges::views::transform, std::ranges::transform_view"},{"path":"ranges/transform_view/iterator","title":"std::ranges::transform_view<V,F>::iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::transform_view<V,F>::iterator<Const>::operator*","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Returns the transformed element."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The transformed element."},{"label":"Notes","note":"operator-> is not provided."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":97,"codeBlockCount":0}
